# AI session system

Use the Multigres triangle: system, expertise, discipline.

- Durable truth lives in repository docs and tests, not chat history.
- Read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/ENGINEERING.md`, and `docs/STAGES.md` before broad work.
- Define the expected correct output before interpreting a result.
- Split large work into independently verifiable stages.
- End each stage with build/lint evidence and a handoff in `docs/STAGES.md`.
- If an agent says “done,” require the command, exit status, and affected API/DB field.
- Fix root causes; do not hide design errors behind local patches.
